  "details": "I do not have a lot of specific information about this, but I'll do my best.\nMy friend randomly crashed in a friends + world, the same world as I was in. But upon entering the world after restarting VRC, 5 seconds later he would be gone. \nThis is what happened in his words: \"I crash, headset freezes, restart VRChat, join off of (a friend), it loads, initializes, then immediately boots me back to my homeworld. then it doesnt give me the option to join through social menu. first time it was me turning off my personal mirror, second time it was me changing an avatar both times headset froze and crashed Steam VR. Both times it crashed the exact same way, where the picture on my headset froze And I got the \"unexpected error window\" from steam vr\".\n\nAfter the 3rd try, he got the anti-cheat error saying he is running a modded install, but he has no mods installed.\n\nWe were required to make an entirely new instance because of not only my friend, but all people trying to join being booted from the world. Making a new instance fixed the issue. This issue is seeming to affect a lot of people and must be stopped immediately.",
